            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Annie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I couldn't believe it, but the wine with ginger was very tasty. My folks liked it too. I added some more veggis, such as fresh bean sprouts and served it with basmati rice cooked in coconut milk.",
